 # GPU Voxelization via Compute Shaders
 
-Also called: AHD GPU Voxelizer, AfterHumanDeclined, AfterHumanDeclined (AHD) GPU Voxelizer, GPU Boxelizer, GPUVoxelizer, VoxelizerX12, VoxelizerX
